repository-code: "https://github.com/SeanWang5868/xpid"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/xpid/"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Xpid is a chemically informed software package for detecting XH–π
  interactions in macromolecular structures. It combines monomer-library-based
  chemical perception and hydrogen placement with conformational sampling of
  supported rotatable X–H groups, steric filtering, crystallographic symmetry
  contacts, and the Hudson and Plevin geometric criteria.
keywords:
  - "XH–π interaction"
  - "structural biology"
  - "macromolecular crystallography"
  - "protein structure"
  - "Gemmi"
